But upscaling SVG to 2x then down at draw could blur slightly; SVG intrinsic sizes are small (140x180) and displayed at ~60px, so 2x is plenty. For buildings displayed maybe artW 150*s up to 255, intrinsic maybe 220x300 -> 2x is 440x600, good.

But canvas copies increase memory; fine.

Also maybe use `createImageBitmap` with resize, but async. Canvas copy synchronous in onload.

Test by patching loadSprite. Then reload and measure.

